      hu: ["Londont 1826-ban alapították közigazgatási székhelyként.", "A Western University-t 1878-ban hozták létre.", "A Thames-folyó az egész városon keresztülhalad.", "London több Fortune 500-as biztosítótársaság székhelye.", "A Budweiser Gardens fontos sport- és szórakoztató központ.", "A 'Sunningdale' negyed híres történelmi tölgyfáiról."],
      ro: ["London a fost fondat în 1826 ca reședință administrativă.", "Western University a fost inaugurată în anul 1878.", "Râul Thames traversează întregul teritoriu al orașului.", "London găzduiește sedii ale unor companii de asigurări Fortune 500.", "Budweiser Gardens este un centru major de sport și divertisment.", "Cartierul „Sunningdale” este cunoscut pentru stejarii săi istorici."],
      en: ["London was founded as an administrative center in 1826.", "Western University was originally established in 1878.", "The Thames River flows through the heart of the city.", "London is a base for several Fortune 500 insurance companies.", "Budweiser Gardens is a premier sports and entertainment venue.", "The Sunningdale neighborhood is famous for its historic oak trees."],
