      hu: ["1749-ben alapították Petite Côte néven.", "Kanada legdélebbi városa, az északi szélesség 42. fokán.", "A Windsori Egyetem otthona, amelyet 1963-ban alapítottak.", "Az Ambassador hidat 1929-ben adták át a forgalomnak.", "A Stellantis (korábban Chrysler) kanadai központja.", "A rabszolgákat segítő földalatti vasút fontos végállomása volt."],
      ro: ["Fondat în 1749 sub numele de Petite Côte.", "Cel mai sudic oraș din Canada, la 42 de grade latitudine nordică.", "Găzduiește Universitatea din Windsor, fondată în 1963.", "Podul Ambassador a fost deschis în anul 1929.", "Sediul central canadian al companiei Stellantis (fostul Chrysler).", "Terminal major al Căii Ferate Subterane în secolul al XIX-lea."],
      en: ["Founded in 1749 as the settlement of Petite Côte.", "Southernmost city in Canada at 42 degrees North latitude.", "Home to the University of Windsor, established in 1963.", "The Ambassador Bridge was opened to traffic in 1929.", "Canadian headquarters of Stellantis (formerly Chrysler).", "Significant terminal on the Underground Railroad in the 1800s."],
