      en: ["Incorporated as a municipality in 1892.", "Home to the British Columbia Institute of Technology (BCIT).", "Central Park contains the Swangard Stadium.", "Headquarters of the world's largest Electronic Arts studio.", "Metropolis at Metrotown is the largest shopping mall in BC.", "Burnaby Village Museum is an open-air museum set in the 1920s."],
