      en: ["Meaning \"red fish up the river\" in the Coast Salish language.", "Served by the Evergreen Extension of the SkyTrain Millennium Line.", "Mundy Park covers approximately 178 hectares of forest.", "Coquitlam Centre is a major regional shopping mall.", "Hosts the annual BC Highland Games event.", "The city was incorporated as a district in 1891."],
