      en: ["Founded in 1861 through the amalgamation of several smaller riverfront parishes.", "Home to the first credit union in North America, established in 1900.", "The Davie Shipbuilding yard is the oldest and largest facility of its kind in Canada.", "Offers a 15-kilometer multipurpose trail known as the Parcours des Anses.", "Named after Henri de Lévis, the Duke of Ventadour and Viceroy of New France.", "The city is a major transportation hub connecting the Atlantic provinces to Quebec."],
