      en: ["Peterborough was the first city in Canada to install electric streetlights in 1884.", "The Peterborough Lift Lock was designated a National Historic Site in 1979.", "The Canadian Canoe Museum moved to a brand-new facility at the waterfront in 2024.", "Trent University is consistently ranked as a top undergraduate university in Ontario.", "The city is a central point on the historic Trent-Severn Waterway.", "Peterborough is the home of the Peterborough Petes, the oldest continuously operating OHL team."],
