      en: ["Granby was officially incorporated as a municipality in 1859.", "The Zoo de Granby is home to more than 1,500 animals representing over 225 different species.", "Lake Boivin is an artificial lake created by the construction of a dam on the Yamaska River.", "The city is often called the cycling capital of Canada due to its network of over 97 kilometers of bike paths.", "The Miner rubber factory in Granby was once one of the largest employers in the Canadian rubber industry.", "The International Song Festival of Granby is a prestigious event for Francophone music artists."],
