      en: ["Formed in 1973 by merging Bowmanville and two townships.", "Home to the Darlington Nuclear Generating Station.", "Site of the renowned Canadian Tire Motorsport Park.", "The municipal seat is located in the community of Bowmanville.", "Includes the areas of Courtice, Newcastle, Orono, and Bowmanville.", "Member of the Regional Municipality of Durham."],
