      en: ["The modern city of Victoriaville was officially established on July 7, 1993.", "Victoriaville is often referred to as the 'Cradle of Recycling' in Canada.", "Wilfrid Laurier, Canada's seventh Prime Minister, practiced law and lived in Arthabaska.", "Mount Arthabaska provides a 360-degree panoramic view of the Bois-Francs region.", "The city is a significant producer of dairy products and Quebec maple syrup.", "The Beaudet Reservoir is a designated stopover for thousands of migrating snow geese."],
