      en: ["The Seigneury of Rimouski was granted on April 24, 1696, to Augustin Rouer de la Cardonnière.", "The devastating 1950 fire is historically remembered as 'La Nuit rouge' (The Red Night).", "Rimouski is home to the Université du Québec à Rimouski, a leader in marine sciences.", "The Pointe-au-Père Maritime Historic Site features the Empress of Ireland shipwreck museum.", "Saint-Barnabé Island is located just 3 kilometers offshore from the city harbor.", "Rimouski is often called the student capital of Eastern Quebec due to its high student ratio."],
